# README Update Before Test and Commit

- Before running any test command, update `README.md` to include all newly implemented features and technical changes.
- Before creating any git commit, update `README.md` so it reflects the current implementation.
- Do not run tests or commit until `README.md` has been synchronized with the latest code changes.
